PART 3 -- THE UNIVERSAL STATEMENT: the constitution in (M500, x) only
====================================================================================================
  the complete closed form (u = r_M/R500(M500), c = 10^c0 (M500/8e14)^q x^-p):
      s_b = 1 / (1 + c x / u)
      s_ph = (x/u) / (1 + c x / u)
      s_d = (c - 1)(x/u) / (1 + c x / u)      [c >= 1; c < 1 = the
            uncapped overshoot, the dust sector saturates at 0]

